Z||000005||BAM-BAM||04-15-2001||12:30 PM||||  Thanks guys, I enjoy them very much.<BR>SS, The wheels and tires lugs and all, including a replacement warrenty on the tires, came to $1106.00 total. The tires were supposed to be 169.00 each but they had originaly quoted me 101. each, so they let me have them for $99.00 each. I don't know if that's a deal or not because I rarely trust retail prices. If they can give them to me for $99.00 each with out even a hesitation, it makes me wonder. I'll take some better pics in the sunlight today and post them this afternoon. <BR> MoFi, I am fairly sure that the guy scamed me and I have let go of it. He is supposed to send me my deposite back this week and that's what I want right now. My 3.4 should be in tuesday. So, I'll be distrcted for while.   <BR>I'll have some "SUNNY" pics up later.  <P>  Peace, B2OUT!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <P>------------------<BR>Knowledge is POWER!<BR>That is why the ignorant remain Weak!||||reg||12
